    "rich_text_HtzdJX": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "text_XHzyht": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Lock Bracelets from Shamballa Jewels<br/>Welcome to Shamballa Jewels’ exclusive collection of Lock Bracelets. These bracelets combine innovative design with luxurious materials and precise craftsmanship, creating jewelry that is both elegant and functional. Our Lock Bracelets are the ultimate choice for those seeking something unique and stylish.<br/><br/>Choice of Bead Sizes<br/>Our Lock Bracelets are available in two bead sizes: 10mm and 6mm. These sizes give you the flexibility to choose the expression that best suits your style. The 10mm beads offer a bold and striking appearance, while the 6mm beads provide a more subtle and sophisticated look.<br/><br/>World-Class Materials<br/>Shamballa Jewels’ Lock Bracelets are made from the finest materials, including 18-karat gold, rose gold, white gold, and black rhodinated gold. These materials ensure not only the durability of the bracelet but also an incomparable aesthetic appeal. No matter which variant you choose, you will experience a sense of luxury and elegance that lasts a lifetime.<br/><br/>Elegance with Diamonds and Precious Stones<br/>Each Lock Bracelet is adorned with white or black diamonds, as well as other gemstones, adding an extra dimension of beauty and luxury. The white diamonds bring light and clarity to the design, while the black diamonds add a mysterious and sophisticated aura. The combination of diamonds and gemstones makes each bracelet unique and captivating.<br/><br/>Customization: Create Your Perfect Bracelet<br/>At Shamballa Jewels, we offer the option to customize your Lock Bracelets according to your personal preferences. Choose from various materials, bead sizes, and gemstones to create a bracelet that is uniquely yours. Our experienced artisans will work with you to ensure that your bracelet is exactly as you wish.<br/><br/>Jewelry for Women and Men<br/>Our Lock Bracelets are designed for both women and men who appreciate exclusive and innovative jewelry. With their timeless design and high quality, these bracelets are the perfect choice for anyone looking to express their personal style with a touch of luxury.<br/><br/>Visit Shamballa Jewels<br/>We invite you to explore our collection of Lock Bracelets at our store in Copenhagen or online. If you have questions or wish to create a bespoke bracelet, our team is ready to assist you. Experience the unique elegance and innovation of Shamballa Jewels’ Lock Bracelets and find the perfect bracelet that suits your style.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
